# PROPOSED GitHub CODEOWNERS — NOT ACTIVE.
# To activate: replace each @P*_GITHUB_USERNAME with the member's real GitHub username,
# then copy this file to .github/CODEOWNERS in a PR reviewed by all four members.
# Enforcement ("Require review from Code Owners") needs branch protection; on a PRIVATE repo
# that requires GitHub Pro/Team (see TEAM_SETUP_REPORT.md section 7). Without it, this file only
# auto-requests reviewers. In GitHub CODEOWNERS the LAST matching line wins.
# Mirrors docs/team_v3/OWNERSHIP_MAP.csv (which uses first-match order) - keep both in sync.

